		cas-mech:MechanicalComponent
		;
	skos:definition "In Electrical/Mechanical Design Collaboration, both design disciplines involved will collaborate in a common 3D space in order to adjust and coordinate allocation, dimensioning and positioning of components."@en ;
	.

<http://www.omg.org/spec/CASCaRA/activities/ProductDevelopment/ProductDesign/MechanicalDesign>
